[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 32168.07, "timestamp": "08:56:08", "text": "這很糟糕。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 32172.708, "timestamp": "08:56:12", "text": "呃，您尚未驗證身份"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 32175.308, "timestamp": "08:56:15", "text": "，因此無法發送消息"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 32177.27, "timestamp": "08:56:17", "text": "。什麼音樂 85. 五，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 32187.83, "timestamp": "08:56:27", "text": "兄弟。我必須付錢。這完全是個騙局。  搞什麼鬼？  我必須購買高級會員。我白白浪費了400塊錢。我覺得你從ASMR那裡得到了支持。其中一人在一次突襲中把我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 32191.19, "timestamp": "08:56:31", "text": "扔到了這裡。  什麼？您好，Guardian Gaming。我剛"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 32194.308, "timestamp": "08:56:34", "text": "醒來。完全"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 32197.27, "timestamp": "08:56:37", "text": "不知道發生了什麼。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 32211.708, "timestamp": "08:56:51", "text": "我認為"}]